WEBVTT

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.710
A mermaid...?

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:00.580
S-sorry!

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:39.420
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:56.460
<b>Mermaid</b>

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:56.460
<b>The Girl of Water City</b>

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.080
She's not trying to attack me.

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:58.380
Could it be? Is this mermaid actually...

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:00.670
You okay?

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:01.880
She spoke!

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.420
You're bleeding.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.540
Huh? Oh!

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.960
Would you happen to be a Xenos, by chance?

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.830
You smell... like Rei!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.830
You know Miss Rei?

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:36.580
Yeah. Rei is pretty and Rido is a cutie.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.920
And Gross is a shy one.

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.080
"A cutie"?

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.630
"A shy one"?

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:47.500
Uh, so, my name is Bell...

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:51.710
Bell. Bell.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.250
I am Bell.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:54.830
"Bell"?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.710
I'm Marie!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.130
Miss Marie, huh?

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:07.630
Bell. Lick this.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:08.630
Huh?!

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.210
Just lick it and swallow.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.580
Lick it and swallow!

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:17.880
Hurry up!

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:19.830
Keep going!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:22.880
O-oh man...

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:27.080
This would look really bad
if someone walked in on us right now!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:30.750
Huh?

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:33.000
I'm recovering?

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.040
Wait a minute, is this the lifeblood of a mermaid?!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.670
I know it's supposed to be a rare healing item...

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.710
Showwy... and tankchu bery murch...

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.380
You're all better now!

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:47.420
What a relief.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.290
It stings a little...

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.790
Ah! I'm s-sorry!

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:04.750
I don't like this place.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:06.460
Let's go over there.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.290
Over where, exactly?

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.500
Heh. Not half bad!

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:36.250
Sh-she's a powerhouse.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:39.080
There's no doubt that Bell Cranel
is extraordinarily strong.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.830
But Antianeira is also a force to be reckoned with.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:44.880
You sure you're okay, Dormul?

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:48.580
I mean, you guys got hit by that parasite plant too.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:49.960
Don't sweat it.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.960
We're built tougher than wimpy elves like you, after all.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:57.500
But as much as I hate to say it,
we can't fight for shit right now.

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:01.290
So we at least gotta carry
our weight by acting like Supporters.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.710
Your assistance is greatly appreciated.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.330
Yeah, thanks a lot.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.580
Shucks, it ain't nothing!

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.540
Dwarves are who you call when you need muscle!

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:19.250
By the way, we heard that your party came down here
as part of a quest to find a missing adventurer.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:21.290
I take it you haven't found them?

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.040
No, we did.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:28.170
They were at the safety point on the 28th floor,
with their body wrapped up in vines...

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.210
They had been killed.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.960
At the safety point?!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:37.750
Yeah. I'm betting that monster was
waiting there to ambush them.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:41.210
And what's more, the corpse had been
hidden under a bunch of rocks.

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:42.960
I can't believe it would do that...

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:47.290
It must've known that adventurers would start being
more vigilant if the body was discovered.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.130
This monster is way too damn clever.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:54.330
Is there any other information you have about
the monster that you can share with us?

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:58.830
Afraid not. It got the jump on us soon after we turned
back to head for the surface.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.250
We tried everything from punches to slashes.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:04.540
But nothing worked, not even the
magic lightning sword I keep for emergencies.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:09.170
In the end, we got shot with those seeds and
it took all of our effort just to get away.

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.290
If that's the case,

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:15.250
then Bell Cranel's magic is the only thing
we know of that can actually hurt it.

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:17.500
So fire must be its weakness.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.460
Then we should arm ourselves with magic fire swords.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.500
You're our ace in the hole.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.290
I know those magic swords of yours are stupidly strong,

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:29.790
so they're almost sure to deal some kind
of damage to that enhanced monster.

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:31.420
Sure. You can count me.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:36.080
But we've been getting swarmed down here.
I just hope we don't run out of swords before then.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.750
Worse case scenario, we can make
use of Haruhime's level boost.

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:43.130
Although I'd really hate to waste it fighting
against a bunch of small fries.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:46.330
Let's do our best to avoid tipping our hand.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:50.710
Because it's going to be impossible to predict
what that monster might try to pull...

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.670
Where did Miss Marie get off to?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.000
That voice...

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.170
Hey Bell!

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:08.040
I'm glad I found you, Miss Marie!

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.210
What's the matter?

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.000
Uh, nothing! It's just...

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.500
Wait here!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.880
Um, where are you going?

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:35.790
Bell!

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:38.750
A b-bra?!

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:41.500
I got clothes! Just like you humans!

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:48.460
Do you know the Xenos, Miss Marie?
Like Mr. Rido and all the others?

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:51.420
"Miss Marie"? But I'm Marie!

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:56.500
Oh, sorry. Adding "Miss" and "Mister" to someone's name
is part of human culture, you see...

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.500
Just call me "Marie"!

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:03.290
M-Marie...

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.790
Yeah! Marie! I'm Marie!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:11.080
You didn't answer my question.
Are you friends with Mr. Rido and the othe-

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.000
"Mr. Rido"?

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.330
I mean, Rido... and the other Xenos.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:21.000
Is everybody else down here with you?

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:23.460
Rido went further up with the group.

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:26.080
To a higher floor?

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.750
Rei and the others always stick together.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:32.250
But I can't fly like she does.

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:34.380
And I can't walk like Rido does.

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:38.040
So... I'm always left waiting here for them.

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:41.380
I see. That sounds pretty lonely.

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.880
Let's talk about more stuff, Bell!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.790
Marie, listen to me.

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:49.170
I have to leave and find a way back to my friends.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.130
I'd love to talk more with you, but...

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.380
Could you guide me to wherever other humans are?

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.630
Leaving is a bad idea. This is a safe place.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.540
I always sing and play here without any problems.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:03.580
Marie...

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.330
But there is a scary thing waiting if you leave.

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:12.000
I saw it myself! The scary thing was
attacking some humans... your friends.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.170
Are you talking about the enhanced species?!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.880
That big green monster?!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:19.670
Marie...

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:24.380
I want to put a stop to that monster.
But I don't know where it is.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:26.960
You can't! Stay here, Bell!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.830
Otherwise, you and I will die...

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.290
And everyone else, too.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:35.960
I'm scared!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:43.130
What is it?

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:44.630
Something feels off.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:47.380
There's too much tension in the air.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.210
What do you mean, Lady Aisha?

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.380
Monsters incoming!

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.960
There are too many! We gotta use the magic swords!

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:07.330
More are coming from the rear!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.580
How the hell?!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:15.210
Uh oh! There's even more on the right!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.630
They're also coming from this way!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.080
I don't believe it...

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:21.580
What is happening?!

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:23.210
Obnoxious little shits!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:39.790
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:44.460
A goddamn monster... put us
in the middle of a pass parade?!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.540
I'm scared, Bell.

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:56.290
Listen to me, Marie.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.630
I have to defeat that Moss Huge no matter what.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.210
So I really need your help.

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.460
Please guide me through the dungeon.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.500
No! It's too scary! You'll die, Bell!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:08.710
I'm not going to die.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.630
Trust me when I say I'll wipe that monster out.

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:14.080
Can you do that, Marie?

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:16.670
I don't want you to be scared any longer.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.500
Please. I need your help.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:22.420
Is that true, Bell?

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:24.540
You won't get killed?

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:26.290
Yeah. I promise you.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:29.580
And you'll make the scary monster go away forever?

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.580
I'll put it down for good.

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.040
Really?

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:35.170
Cross my heart.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.250
Okay, I'll do it! I'll be your guide, Bell!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.080
What was that?

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:09.330
I found it!

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:10.960
That way!

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:13.880
There's a more docile monster than me who agreed to
help out!

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.670
A mermaid's song...

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.920
No way! Can it actually mesmerize other monsters?!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.630
Let's go, Bell!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.250
Okay! I'm coming!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.750
This is impossible! A monster can't cause a pass parade!

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:38.080
That bastard! We're in deep shit now!

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.330
Don't fall behind or you'll get swarmed by monsters!

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:42.830
Just keep running!

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.330
My legs are turning into jelly!

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:49.130
A snail moves faster than you! Get the lead out, dammit!

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.920
Stuff it, you oversized piece of luggage!

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:56.130
Haruhime has a spell that could
get us out of this mess for sure.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.540
But it's too early to use it.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.080
Plus, that Moss Huge is definitely
watching from somewhere!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.630
OUTTA THE WAY!

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.920
Get ready, Blacksmith!

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:22.880
Sure!

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.000
You know I could do this all day!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.920
This way, Bell!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:33.750
Your friends are running from
a whole bunch of monsters right now!

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.540
Is that Moss Huge one of them?

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:37.130
Yeah! It is!

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.920
Bell! Come on, this way!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:58.540
Huh? Uh, okay!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.420
Hell Kaios!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.330
They just keep coming!

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.750
Don't wimp out me now, Blacksmith!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:47.540
Goddammit. I really hate getting shown up.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:50.330
But out of respect for how adept you are with that axe...

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:51.630
I'll let you off the hook!

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:54.500
Thanks! It's putting in work!

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.830
Our vanguard is really giving them hell.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:05.830
This is our chance to press on.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:06.880
Right.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.830
Let's get as far as we can!

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:14.710
The hell is that?!

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:19.420
A Crystaroth Urchin?!

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:21.130
Dodge it, you guys!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:22.630
It'll make mince meat out of you!

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.040
Yo, Big Guy!

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:28.920
Don't be stupid! Get outta there!

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:29.960
I can't!

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.750
Chigusa and the others won't make it!

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:34.500
If we let it go past us,
then someone's gonna get hit for sure!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:35.500
Master Ouka!

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.630
Lady Mikoto?! It's too risky!

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:44.460
Don't, Mikoto!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.380
I've trained for this. And I have a good weapon.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.250
Now all I need to do...

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:50.920
is be like Master Bell!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.830
It's a superb technique, but...

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.420
I'd rethink that name if I were you.

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.080
That's okay, this is the name I want to use!

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:04.330
It's meant to honor the alias
that I received from the gods!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:06.710
Zekka!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:06.920
<b>Note: "Absolute Flower"</b>

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:12.670
Whoa. Holy crap!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:14.750
S-she cut it!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.500
Split it right in two!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.960
That was incredible, Mikoto!

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:20.920
Let's hurry on, everyone.

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.830
With the light of heaven once refused,

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.580
arms of mercy bring salvation to my heinous figure.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.960
Make up for my words that cannot reach,

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:32.960
and save my poor companions.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.210
Now's your chance, Master Welf! Master Ouka!

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.210
Oh solar rays,

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.920
I beseech you to ward off affliction.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.460
Soul Light!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:45.330
All good.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.330
Thank you!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:49.040
You're cutting it kinda close with these heals, Lil Squeak!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:51.830
There's a time frame we have to stick to because
it's not something that we can use will-nilly!

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:55.500
Why are you fighting with each other
after I just healed you?!

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:58.250
Up ahead! We have enemies coming from the water!

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:02.170
Four seconds until I hit them with a magic sword!

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:03.040
Got it!

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:16.460
I'm impressed.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:19.540
I thought this party was doomed without Bell Cranel.

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.670
But apparently, I misjudged them.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:25.210
Guess I'm done giving out faint praise.
They've earned my respect.

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:28.750
This is more than a party that
just relies on me for protection!

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.420
I thought you promised me...

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:35.960
We're supposed to go together.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:38.540
But I can't go any further.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.330
It's that Aqua Serpent from earlier!

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.170
Here it comes again!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:57.040
Sorry about this, Marie!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:07.540
Amazing! You're so fast, Bell!

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:08.880
That should get the monster off our tail...

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.250
I've never done anything like this before!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:11.920
This is so much fun!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:14.290
D-D-D-DON'T CLING TO ME!

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:19.000
We'll make our stand against the monsters here.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:22.630
There isn't any water around for them
to attack us from. And we have a clear view.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:25.830
Draw them in and then scorch them
all at once with your magic sword.

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.750
Will his sword last long enough?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.830
Continuing to flee will just make things worse.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.670
We have to do something to reduce
the number of monsters eventually,

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.250
or nothing will change.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.880
Okay. Sounds good.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.460
Koga!

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:47.250
That's some intense heat.

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:49.170
Oh no!

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:50.920
What is it, Mikoto?

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:03.380
Of all the goddamn times!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:06.630
This is a mass outbreak of one species...

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:09.170
A monster party!

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:11.670
Crap! We're totally not equipped to handle this!

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.580
They're spawning from all over the place.

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:14.920
There's no way out!

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.130
Lady Aisha...?

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:22.000
Well, I'm still concerned about that Moss Huge...

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.630
but if we're gonna use it then now is the time.

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:29.380
Listen up, boys.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:33.710
Will you swear on your life that you'll never speak
of what you're about to witness to anyone?

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.630
What are you talking about? We don't have time for this!

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:36.750
Yes or no?!

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:38.830
S-sure, you have my word.

